Based on the security assessment, here are specific code fixes to address the identified vulnerabilities:

## 1. Install Required Dependencies

```bash
npm install helmet express-validator express-rate-limit
```

## 2. Implement Security Headers with Helmet

```javascript
const express = require('express');
const helmet = require('helmet');
const app = express();

// Apply security headers
app.use(helmet());

// Optional: Configure helmet with specific options
/*
